{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜大致多雲　稍後有一兩陣微雨\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-261122-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。本港地區今日(11月22日)天氣預測，大致多雲，稍後有一兩陣微雨，氣溫徘徊在23度左右，吹和緩至清勁偏東風，離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><p>展望星期一多雲，初時風勢仍然頗大。本周中期轉吹偏北風，天氣轉涼及有幾陣雨。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T23:40:18.962098+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T22:54:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T12:57:17.259473+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T23:33:37.926974+00:00","content_hash":"2239d0ce5dcb2a85b03b97df5017670692a6ed16e97653323945e7b884e0a858","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T23:40:18.962098+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}